    "description": "# RF-13: Pause Automation\n\n_Reversible pause action that blocks new attribution only, per the prototype's Pause modal._\n\n### AUTOMATION\n\n* Reason — Picklist: Awaiting Ops Verification, Proof Quality Under Review, Payout Details Missing or Invalid, Duplicate Under Review, Referrer Request, Other\n* Notes — required if Reason = Other\n* Reversible; blocks new attribution only\n\n* Consistent with RF-11's flag-don't-block approach for existing Sign Ups naming this referrer.\n\n### IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n\n* Not confirmed in the transcript\n\n* Sourced from the prototype's Pause modal only.\n\n### NOTES\n\n* Provenance: RF-13 (Referrer Record User Stories doc).\n\n### SOURCE\n\n* [Taryn doc RF-13 — Referrer Record User Stories](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MsJXwt3oY-DyQuAdMzNYlyPenKUQl7g8mHzMmeRaVHs/edit?tab=t.lh55xwl5syhi)\n* Dependencies: [BUILD-185 — Referrer: Object + Core Status](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693311564006/f/)\n* Owner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n* Created 2026-08-20 from Referrer record documentation review.\n\n",
